{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RetryPolicy","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Retrying matters because the buffers are cleared at flush time: without it a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"failed save only ever reaches disk if the user happens to touch the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity again, which is silent data loss. Retrying ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"forever","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" matters just as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"much in the other direction — a write that can never succeed (disk full, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model the container can’t encode, a schema mismatch) must not keep the stack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"busy indefinitely. So attempts are bounded, and running out is an event the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app can see rather than a silence.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/retrypolicy"]}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/init(maxAttempts:baseDelay:maxDelay:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy\/baseDelay"